
---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Ariel J. Segués"
  description="Ariel J. Segués is an immersive audio and spatial sound designer based in Barcelona, creating sound experiences for installations, exhibitions and audiovisual environments."
>
  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="about-topline">
        <p class="eyebrow">
          <span class="about-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          ABOUT / 01
        </p>
        <span class="about-hero-meta">
          IMMERSIVE AUDIO / SPATIAL SOUND
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1 id="about-title">
        Sound that
        <br />
        <span>shapes</span> space.
      </h1>

      <div class="about-hero-bottom">
        <p class="intro">
          I'm an immersive audio and sound designer working across
          spatial sound, audiovisual installations and environments.
          I create sonic experiences that shape how people perceive
          and interact with a space.
        </p>

        <div class="about-hero-index" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>BARCELONA, SPAIN</span>
          <span>WORKING WORLDWIDE ↗</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content" aria-label="Profile and approach">
      <div class="about-column about-profile">
        <p class="section-label">02 / Approach</p>

        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            I approach sound as a way of <em>shaping space and experience.</em>
            Working across sound design, spatial composition and
            multichannel mixing, I create sound environments for
            installations, exhibitions and audiovisual projects.
          </p>

          <p>
            My practice brings together creative exploration and
            technical precision — from the design of individual sounds
            to the composition and implementation of complex
            multichannel systems.
          </p>

          <p>
            With a background in music production, audio engineering
            and computer science, I move between artistic and technical
            processes to find the right sonic language for each project.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-column about-services">
        <div class="about-services-heading">
          <p class="section-label">03 / What I do</p>
          <span class="about-count">AUDIO PRACTICE</span>
        </div>

        <div class="services">
          <div class="service">
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong>
            <span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="service">
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>Spatial Audio</strong>
            <span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="service">
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>Multichannel Mixing</strong>
            <span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="service">
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>Audiovisual Installations</strong>
            <span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="service">
            <span>05</span>
            <strong>Interactive Sound</strong>
            <span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="service">
            <span>06</span>
            <strong>Audio Systems & Implementation</strong>
            <span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-formats" aria-label="Audio formats and tools">
      <div class="about-formats-heading">
        <p class="section-label">04 / Technical practice</p>
        <span class="about-count">SELECTED FORMATS & TOOLS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-formats-grid">
        <div class="about-format">
          <span class="format-label">Audio formats</span>
          <p>Stereo <i>·</i> Surround <i>·</i> Multichannel <i>·</i> Spatial Audio</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-format">
          <span class="format-label">Audio & production</span>
          <p>Sound Design <i>·</i> Mixing <i>·</i> Audio Engineering</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-format">
          <span class="format-label">Interactive tools</span>
          <p>Wwise <i>·</i> FMOD <i>·</i> Unity <i>·</i> Unreal Engine</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-credits" aria-label="Working details">
      <div class="about-credit">
        <p class="section-label">Location</p>
        <p>Barcelona, Spain</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-credit">
        <p class="section-label">Working with</p>
        <p>
          Cultural institutions, exhibition spaces, artists,
          creative studios and audiovisual productions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-credit">
        <p class="section-label">Availability</p>
        <p>
          <span class="about-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Remote · Worldwide
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-photo" aria-label="About Ariel">
      <div class="about-photo-frame">
        <img
          src="/images/about.jpg"
          alt="Ariel J. Segués"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />

        <div class="about-photo-caption">
          <span>ARIEL J. SEGUÉS</span>
          <span>SOUND / SPACE / EXPERIENCE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-contact" aria-labelledby="about-contact-title">
      <p class="section-label">05 / Next step</p>

      <h2 id="about-contact-title">
        Let's create
        <br />
        <span>space for sound.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="about-contact-description">
        Have an installation, exhibition or audiovisual project in mind?
        Let's explore what sound can bring to it.
      </p>

      <a href="/contact" class="about-contact-link">
        Get in touch
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
